      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, right side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>(In the name of God, Merciful and Compassionate).</li>\n<li>Folios</li>\n<li>with what comprises the total revenue of the below-named districts</li>\n<li>that continue to belong to the assignation of the troops, the men of</li>\n<li>the Emir the Divinely Triumphant, the Emir Contender for the Religion, Pride of emirs,</li>\n<li>and of the retinue of the Valiant One of Kings, Leader of Armies,</li>\n<li>Knight of the Turks and their Valiant One, Ab\u016b Man\u1e63\u016br \u1ffeAl\u012b b. \u1ffeAl\u012b al-\u1ffe\u0100\u1e0did\u012b</li>\n<li>al-N\u0101\u1e63ir\u012b, from the sowing of the year 562,</li>\n<li>according to the supplements brought by the surveyors</li>\n<li>on which are affixed the signatures of the estimators, and the documents</li>\n<li>submitted by the secretaries of the named districts.</li>\n<li>These being:</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
