      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, left side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Bas\u016b\u1e6d Nah\u012bsah and Ma\u1e25allat B\u016b l-Haytam,</li>\n<li>Naw\u0101j and Damsh\u012bt,</li>\n<li>(and) Minyat B\u016b l-\u1ffeA\u1e6d\u0101f.</li>\n<li>Of gold.</li>\n<li>And of crops:</li>\n<li>wheat,</li>\n<li>barley</li></ol>\n",
